"role.tanukiSuperHero.name" : "Super Hero"
"role.tanukiSuperHero.short" : "Hero"
"role.tanukiSuperHero.blurb" : "Raise your voice. Become the light."
"role.tanukiSuperHero.generalBlurb" : "Raise your voice. Become the light."
"role.tanukiSuperHero.doc" : "A Crewmate role.<br>Press the ability button, then say “henshin” (変身) to transform.<br>While surrounded by light, gain invulnerability and a kill ability.<br>Attempting to kill a Crewmate kills only you instead.<br>Evil Hero can still kill you while transformed."
"role.tanukiSuperHero.tips" : "Press the ability button, then say “henshin” (変身) within the waiting period.<br>Desktop and .NET clients recognise their own microphone locally. Only Web/mobile participants are recognised by the host.<br>Loudness alone never activates this ability. Recognition must be ready before using the button.<br>Transformation duration and successful-transformation cooldown are configurable separately for each hero. A failed keyword attempt always has a one-second retry cooldown.<br>Meetings, death, game end and role removal end the transformation."
"role.tanukiEvilHero.name" : "Evil Hero"
"role.tanukiEvilHero.short" : "Evil Hero"
"role.tanukiEvilHero.blurb" : "Raise your voice. Unleash the darkness."
"role.tanukiEvilHero.generalBlurb" : "Raise your voice. Unleash the darkness."
"role.tanukiEvilHero.doc" : "An Impostor role.<br>Press the ability button, then say “henshin” (変身) to transform.<br>While surrounded by darkness, gain invulnerability and ordinary kills.<br>You cannot kill before transforming. Killing Crewmates causes no misfire.<br>Super Hero can still kill you while transformed."
"role.tanukiEvilHero.tips" : "Press the ability button, then say “henshin” (変身) within the waiting period.<br>Desktop and .NET clients recognise their own microphone locally. Only Web/mobile participants are recognised by the host.<br>Loudness alone never activates this ability. Recognition must be ready before using the button.<br>Transformation duration and successful-transformation cooldown are configurable separately for each hero. A failed keyword attempt always has a one-second retry cooldown.<br>Meetings, death, game end and role removal end the transformation."
"options.role.tanukiSuperHero.detail" : "Speak to transform into a hero of light with protection and Sheriff-style kills."
"options.role.tanukiSuperHero.cooldown" : "Transformation cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiSuperHero.seconds" : "Transformation duration"
"options.role.tanukiSuperHero.killCooldown" : "Transformed kill cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiSuperHero.waitSeconds" : "Voice arming window"
"options.role.tanukiSuperHero.hideName" : "Hide player name while transformed"
"options.role.tanukiEvilHero.detail" : "Speak to transform into a hero of darkness with protection and kills."
"options.role.tanukiEvilHero.cooldown" : "Transformation cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiEvilHero.seconds" : "Transformation duration"
"options.role.tanukiEvilHero.killCooldown" : "Transformed kill cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiEvilHero.waitSeconds" : "Voice arming window"
"options.role.tanukiEvilHero.hideName" : "Hide player name while transformed"
"button.label.tanukiHero.transform" : "Transform"
"button.label.tanukiHero.speak" : "Say henshin"
"button.label.tanukiHero.active" : "Transformed"
"button.label.tanukiHero.justice" : "Justice"
"button.label.tanukiHero.disconnected" : "Preparing speech"
